//   5      0.008623     0.0125        reservoir right wall
//   6      0.02         0.03          flared right wall
//
//   row (from the bottom)   z range
//   0  bottom band           -0.025   to -0.02
//   1  thin layer            -0.02    to -0.0197
//   2  lower                 -0.0197  to the W-P2 level (-0.013872 inside the cavity)
//   3  chunk, lower          that level to the flat chunk top, z = -0.013
//   4  chunk, top (thin)     -0.013   to -0.0125 (the level of the channel corners P14, P7)
